invariant: INV-65
file: widemul.h
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh x25519-adx
reason: widemul_x25519_cpu runs x25519_adx.c under CH_CPU_BMI2_ADX alone,
  so a session whose caller states nothing about the multiply runs MULX's
  products, whose timing that caller has not stated. Every byte stays
  right. bin/widemul_runtime_test counts the call into x25519_adx.c under
  CH_CPU_BMI2_ADX alone, and the qemu lane runs it for x86-64.

--- old
    if (widemul_native(widemul) && (cpu & CH_CPU_BMI2_ADX) != 0) {
--- new
    if ((cpu & CH_CPU_BMI2_ADX) != 0) {
